CLAUDE.md
POSITIONING.md
docs/HANDOVER_*.md
docs/audit_ecosystem_*.md
docs/guides/
*[Hh]andover*

# Operational / infra kit (maintainer-only; touches the live anchor, DB, or
# server). Public testers don't need these; they expose deployment topology.
deploy/
scripts/anchor_*.py
scripts/check_pg.py
scripts/claim_relic.py
scripts/seed_claimable_relic.py
scripts/serve_artifact_api.py
scripts/forge_collection.py
scripts/forge_hunt_sheets.py
